step.response_schema:
class Effect(BaseModel):
  from_var: str
  to_var: str
  sign: int

class EffectSystem(BaseModel):
  effects: list[Effect]

step.prompt:
Interpret the complete Vester sensitivity analysis:
- Summarize the system and boundaries.
- Explain Active Sum (AS), Passive Sum (PS), P and Q.
- Identify drivers (high AS), reactives (high PS), buffers, and critical variables.
- Interpret the effect system and feedback loops.
- Recommend interventions and a roadmap.
System context: {{system_context}}
Influence matrix: {{influence_matrix}}
Effect system: {{effect_system}}
